# nf-test ignore patterns for workflow tests
# Files that should be ignored in snapshot comparisons

# Pipeline info files (timestamps, versions, etc.)
**/pipeline_info/**

# Work directory
**/work/**

# Log files
**/.nextflow.log*

# Session files
**/.session*

# Temporary files
**/tmp/**

# Large data files (only check existence, not content)
**/*.bam
**/*.bai
**/*.cram
**/*.crai
**/*.vcf.gz
**/*.vcf.gz.tbi

# Data-dependent output files
**/multiqc_data/multiqc_data.json
**/multiqc_data/multiqc_plots.html

# Execution timing (varies between runs)
**/execution_timeline*
**/execution_trace*

# Cache
**/.cache/**
